{
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Open-source download manager for courses (Udemy/Hotmart), YouTube, music & 1,800+ sites. Built with Tauri 2.0, Rust & Svelte. (formerly OmniGet)",
    "homepage": "https://t.me/OpenSelena",
    "license": "GPL-3.0",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/OpenSelena/libreget"
    },
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/OpenSelena/libreget/releases/download/v1.0.0/libreget_1.0.0_x64-portable.exe",
            "hash": "sha256:7d185fb7d8bcdfbefaf5311aed14de251090875ea6ee6d21cc48779eeb4c1a4f"
        }
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "$e = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\*portable.exe\" | Where-Object { $_.Name -match '^(omni|libre)get_.*portable\\.exe$' } | Select-Object -First 1; if ($e -and $e.Name -ne 'omniget.exe') { Rename-Item -Path $e.FullName -NewName 'omniget.exe' -Force }"
    ],
    "bin": "omniget.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "omniget.exe",
            "LibreGet"
        ]
    ],
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/OpenSelena/libreget/releases/download/v$version/libreget_$version_x64-portable.exe"
            }
        }
    },
    "notes": [
        "上游 1.0.0 起由 OmniGet 更名为 LibreGet（仓库 OpenSelena/omniget → OpenSelena/libreget，旧地址仍重定向）。",
        "清单沿用 omniget 名称以保持命令与升级路径不变；pre_install 按 ^(omni|libre)get_.*portable.exe 精确匹配后重命名为 omniget.exe。"
    ]
}
